  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agricultural Market Information System (AMIS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project supports the work of the inter-agency Secretariat of the G20 Agricultural Market Information System (AMIS) hosted by FAO&apos;s Markets and Trade division. It is the follow-up project of MTF/GLO/359/MUL which has funded AMIS activities in the period 2012-2021. Annual work plans will be established in close collaboration with project stakeholders in the framework of the AMIS Rapid Response Forum, building on the agreed objectives and activities that are outlined in the AMIS Umbrella Programme.</narrative>
  </description>
